[ii] The impugned judgment and award passed by Motor Accident Claims Tribunal,
Kopargaon, in MACP No. 99 of 2005 dated 30th October, 2012 is hereby modified as under :-
 [a] Claim petition is partly allowed;
 [b] Opponent - Insurance company shall pay compensation of Rs. 1 Lakh to the claimant along with interest @ 9 % p.a. from the date of filing the claim petition till realization of the whole amount ;
[c] Opponent - insurer shall bear costs of the petition as well as {10} FA 3017.13.odt this appeal.

